1
00:00:00,917 --> 00:00:03,987
(Sheldon:)I went for a walk yesterday
without sunscreen.

2
00:00:05,322 --> 00:00:07,772
(Sheldon:)Do you see anything on my forehead

3
00:00:07,924 --> 00:00:10,424
(Sheldon:)that I should be concerned about?

4
00:00:12,095 --> 00:00:14,805
(Emily:)Um, you know what? I better go.
My movie's about to start.

5
00:00:14,965 --> 00:00:17,135
(Raj:)-Are you here alone?
-No, not really.

6
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:19,800
-What do you mean, "not really"?
-Hey, should we get our seats?

7
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:23,510
(Emily:)Yeah. It was nice seeing you.
I'll call you later.

8
00:00:23,673 --> 00:00:24,673
(Raj:)Yeah, okay.

9
00:00:28,645 --> 00:00:30,125
That was awkward, right'?

10
00:00:33,617 --> 00:00:36,457
(Sheldon:)Is it because she's dating you
but was out with that other fellow?

11
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:37,830
(Sheldon:)-Yes.
-Good.

12
00:00:37,988 --> 00:00:39,588
(Sheldon:)I thought she saw
something on my forehead.

13
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:45,000
(Director:)And... action.

14
00:00:45,162 --> 00:00:48,112
(Wil Wheaton:)-Please don't shut me out.
Go away.

15
00:00:49,099 --> 00:00:51,169
(Penny:)Just go away.

16
00:00:52,035 --> 00:00:54,605
(Wil:)I swear, I will find
a way to turn you back.

17
00:00:54,771 --> 00:01:00,021
(Penny:)What gave you the right to mix my DNA
with that of a killer gorilla?

